OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage centre visitors warned of
OL,4,Adisruption                             
OL,6,FVisitors to one of Leicestershire's    
OL,7,Fbest-known heritage attractions are    
OL,8,Fbeing warned to expect disruption      
OL,9,Fduring #125,000 improvement work.      
OL,11,FBosworth Battlefield Heritage Centre,  
OL,12,Fwhich marks the site where Richard III 
OL,13,Fwas killed after losing the Battle of  
OL,14,FBosworth to Henry Tudor in 1485, is    
OL,15,Fundergoing a four-week programme of    
OL,16,Fupgrades.                              
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
