OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage centre visitors warned of
OL,4,Adisruption                             
OL,6,FThe work, due to begin on Monday,      
OL,7,Fincludes resurfacing and remarking the 
OL,8,Fcar park, relocating disabled parking  
OL,9,Fbays and coach facilities, and         
OL,10,Finstalling new signs and a security    
OL,11,Fgate.                                  
OL,13,FThe heritage centre, 1485 Tithe Barn   
OL,14,Fand car park will be closed while the  
OL,15,Fwork is carried out, officials say.    
